          "The orange (haircare) and red (cosmetics) lines generally slope downward from left to right.",
          "Cosmetics has the widest range of shipping costs, stretching from the lowest end up to the absolute maximum.",
          "A very obvious negative relationship can be observed (Inverse Relationship)."
